title: Day3
---


//Setting up the scene
<<ChangeLocation DialogueSignals "Cell">>

<<SetCharacterLocation DialogueSignals "Cherry" "Cell">>
#pose:neutral

Cherry: Hello {$name}! How are you? #expression:happy

//MC
-> {$name}:Say hi
    <<set $friendship +=1>>
    <<jump hello>>
-> {$name}:(say nothing)
    <<set $friendship -=1>>
    <<jump wrong>>
===
title: hello
---
{$name}: Hello Cherry. I'm okay, how are you?
Cherry: Ah, same old, same old. Glad to talk to you though, as always!
{$name}: Ah. Yeah, same.
Cherry: You're being weird. What's up with you? #expression:neutraL
-> answer gently
<<jump answer>>
-> answer harshly
<<jump answer_harsh>> 

===
title: wrong
---
Cherry: What's wrong with you? Why are you being so silent and grumpy??#expression:sad
-> answer gently
<<jump answer>>
-> answer harshly
<<jump answer_harsh>>
===
title: answer
---
{$name}: Well... I was told something about you yesterday. Something about the day you arrived here. #expression:neutral
Cherry: The day I arrived? What did you hear? I don't remember that day very clearly.
{$name}: You don't? That's a relief.
Cherry: A relief?! What are you on about?
{$name}: You killing a whole bunch of people? The massive Dark Matter explosion you caused? Ringing any bells? #expression:annoyed 
<<jump surprise>>
===
title: answer_harsh
---
{$name}: What's wrong with me?! What's wrong with you!? Why did you kill all those people?! #expression:annoyed
Cherry: What!?
{$name}: The Dark Matter explosion? That was you!
<<jump surprise>>
===
title: surprise
---
Cherry: Wait what? What on earth are you on about?
{$name}: Don't pretend you don't know! You've been here, acting all coy and cheery, when you killed half a dozen people! Some of them were my friends, you know.
Cherry: Really, {$name}, I swear. I don't know what you're talking about. I don't remember the day I got here, at all. 
{$name}: Oh really.
Cherry: Truly. It was... dark. And cold. I remember feeling frozen. And lonely. 
Cherry: Then it wasn't dark, it was black. And there was a loud sound.
{$name}: The explosion.
Cherry: I really don't remember it. I swear. You have to believe me!
-> {$name}: I do (truth) #expression:neutral
        <<set $friendship +=3>>
        <<jump believe>>
-> {$name}: I do (lie)#expression:pensive #pose:sad
        <<set $friendship -=1>>
        <<jump lie>>
-> {$name}: I don't#expression:pensive #pose:sad
        <<set $friendship -=3>>
        <<jump dont>>
===
title: believe
---
Cherry: Thank you. Truly, thank you. I swear it's the truth. 
{$name}: I know.
Cherry: ...But no one else does. Is that why no one else will talk to me? Or even look at me?
{$name}: It must be. There must be something connecting you to the explosion. Why else would everyone assume it's you?
Cherry: I don't know. I don't know why people think it's me. #expression:pensive #pose:sad
Cherry: Please, {$name}, please understand. I would never ever hurt people like that. 
-> reassure
        <<set $friendship +=1>>
        {$name}: Hey it's going to be okay. I believe you. #expression:neutral #pose:neutral
-> say nothing
Cherry: So, what do we do now?
-> investigate
        <<jump investigate>>
-> stay calm
        <<jump calm>>
-> nothing
        <<jump nothing>>
===
title: lie
---
Cherry: Oh {$name}, I figured you'd learnt by now - I know when you're lying. 
{$name}: I'm not!
Cherry: You are, and you're making it worse. If you don't believe me, then that's fine. Whatever.
{$name}: I'm... sorry?
Cherry: Yeah. Sure.
Cherry: ...
Cherry: So, what now?
-> investigate
        <<jump investigate>>
-> stay calm
        <<jump calm>>
-> nothing
        <<jump nothing>>
===
title: dont
---
Cherry: At least you're honest, I suppose. I swear I'm telling the truth, I just don't know how to prove it.
{$name}: Look it's not that personal. Even you've got to admit it's kinda suspicious - a massive Dark Matter explosion happening, and you show up in the rubble?
Cherry: Okay, I get how that seems. But I swear it's a coincidence. 
{$name}: Sure, if you say so.
Cherry: Well, now what? What do we do?
-> investigate #expression:neutral #pose:neutral
        <<jump investigate>>
-> stay calm #expression:neutral #pose:neutral
        <<jump calm>>
-> nothing #expression:neutral #pose:neutral
        <<jump nothing>>
===
title: investigate
---
{$name}: We investigate. We look into the explosion and figure out what happened. I can look into things out here, and ask around, and you can try and find out anything from anyone who comes to talk to you.
Cherry: That's... quite clever. If we can figure out why the explosion happened, maybe we can figure out why I was there.
{$name}: And why you don't remember anything.
Cherry: And maybe... maybe then they'll let me go?
{$name}: We can try, I suppose. #expression:happy
Cherry: Thank you {$name}. It means a lot that you're willing to help me. 
{$name}: Let's just see how this goes before we start thanking anybody.
Cherry: Still...
{$name}: Look, I'd better go, I gotta get back to work. I'll come back tomorrow, and let you know anything I find.
Cherry: Sounds like a plan! Wow, it's almost like we're undercover or something.
{$name}: Sure Cherry, sure. I'll see you tomorrow.
Cherry: See ya {$name}! We'll chat tomorrow.
===
title: calm
---
{$name}: Well, for starters, we stay calm. There's no need to panic or freak out.
Cherry: I'm not freaking out! But I'd like to see how you'd react to being told you apparently killed a bunch of people.
{$name}: ... good point. Still. Guilty or not, there has to be an explanation. So we chill out, maybe ask around a bit, see what happens.
Cherry: Ask around? You think someone saw something, or knows something?
{$name}: I think it doesn't hurt to ask. 
Cherry: Hm.
{$name}: Look, I gotta go, before I get in trouble. I'll probably come back tomorrow, kay? #expression:happy
Cherry: Okay. I'll see you tomorrow then, {$name}.
{$name}: Goodbye Cherry.
===
title: nothing
---
{$name}: We do nothing. #expression:annoyed
Cherry: Nothing?! 
{$name}: Well what would we do? There's nothing we can do. Guilty or innocent, you're still in a cell, and I have no way of knowing the truth!
Cherry: You could still look into it! Just because you don't know, doesn't mean that no one does!
{$name}: I mean I guess, but still. That seems like a very complicated issue to broach, and it might not even help you.
Cherry: You can still ask around!
{$name}: Yeah. Maybe. I'll see I guess.
Cherry: You'll see?
{$name}: Look, I gotta go. I'll talk to you some other time. #expression:neutral
Cherry: Fine. Goodbye, I guess.

===
<<RemoveCharacter DialogueSignals "Scarlet">>
<<EnableNavigation DialogueSignals>>
<<jump Navigation1>>

